# Onyx guest sshd: reachable only through the host's vsock tunnel
# (`onyx ssh` / `ossh`), never from the NAT network. Key auth only; the
# host's per-install key is installed by onyx-guest at every start.
ListenAddress 127.0.0.1
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitRootLogin no
AcceptEnv LANG LC_* TERM
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/ssh/sftp-server
